  "description": "Erection of a part two storey side, single storey rear extension with two roof lanterns and a part first floor rear extension to the house.",
  "development_type": "Other house holder developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall begin not later than three years from the date of this decision.\r\n\r\nReason: In order to comply with Section 91 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990, as amended by Section 51 of the Planning and Compulsory Purchase Act 2004.",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and specifications: PL1/SM/39 - 00, PL1/SM/39 - 01, PL1/SM/39 - 02, PL1/SM/39 - 03, PL1/SM/39 - 04, PL1/SM/39 - 05, PL1/SM/39 - 06, Reasonable Exception Statement (RES), Planning Fire Safety Statement. Received 16/03/2026.\r\nReason: In order to ensure the development is carried out in accordance with the planning permission.",
    "Condition : 3 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building, unless otherwise shown on the approved plans.\r\nReason: In order to safeguard the appearance of the area.",
    "Condition : 4 - The roof area of the single storey rear extension hereby permitted shall not be used as a balcony, roof garden or similar amenity area.\r\nReason: In order to protect neighbours' privacy\r\n",
    "Condition : 5 - No additional windows or openings shall be formed in the side elevations of the development hereby permitted.\r\nReason: In order to protect neighbours' privacy.\r\n"
